<title>HONG KONG: Perfectech interim net down 67.44 pct.</title>
<headline>Perfectech interim net down 67.44 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	2.72   vs 8.36</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) 0.5    vs 0.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			 4.58   vs 14.05</p>
<p>    Turnover		  167.66 vs 276.10</p>
<p>    Company name	    Perfectech International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     September 30 to October 4</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	October 9</p>
<p>NOTE - A maker of plastic packaging and novelties.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end to December 31 from April 30. Comparative figures are for six months ended October 31, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
